      "widgets_values": [
        "IMAGE TO 3D ASSET (TRIPO CLOUD)\n\nUpload a clear image of a single object with the subject fully visible. The Tripo node generates a textured GLB and an FBX output.\n\nRecommended starting settings in the Tripo node: texture ON, PBR ON, texture quality standard, geometry quality standard, orientation align_image, face limit 200000 for a manageable game asset.\n\nThis node uses the connected Tripo / Comfy API service and may require a Comfy account or API key. Generation is a paid cloud operation; the exact price is shown on the node.\n\nThe saved GLB is in D:\\ComfyUI\\output\\3D\\Tripo_Image_Model_*.glb (the exact extension is chosen by the node). Import it into Blender, Unity, Unreal, or your projection app.\n\nOne image cannot recover hidden sides exactly. For a better asset, use a clean background, a centered object, and a second multi-view workflow when available."
